CALLING ALL THE FREAKS Rat City Collective and Not Your Amigo are teaming up for Detroit’s most deliciously devious, curated celebration of the city’s historic night of mischief & foolery, DEVIL’S NIGHT! 

Expect an array of local art, music, drag, vendors, tarot readers, performers and MORE!

MUSIC BY:
@vesolomatelau
@charlestrees b2b @nickdagher
@_djgirl b2b @garrison.xr

Drag artists, visual artists, vendors, and more TBA very soon!

Bring your best devilish looks, prizes will be awarded for best costumes l

 Grab your tickets now on RA + at our link in bio.

Individuality, diversity, queerness, and inclusion of all identities are welcomed and celebrated. There is zero tolerance for hate, distribution, or violence of any type.
